      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we change the return type, then it leads to following errors.\n\nhardware/interfaces/audio/aidl/vts/VtsHalVisualizerTargetTest.cpp:142:13: error: cannot initialize return object of type \u0027bool\u0027 with an rvalue of type \u0027void\u0027\n  142 |             ASSERT_STATUS(EX_NONE, mEffect-\u003egetDescriptor(\u0026desc));",
