      "lineNbr": 145,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-17T16:00:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This error is due to the fact that all `ASSERT_...` macros end up with a `return` statement. Because of that, methods that use `EXPECT_...` and `ASSERT_...` macros can only have `void` return type. Any errors should be reported through these macros, and the caller must wrap every call to this method into `EXPECT|ASSERT_NO_FATAL_FAILURE`.\n\nThat means, on the lines `229–230` we should have something like this:\n\n```\n    ASSERT_NO_FATAL_FAILURE(SetAndGetParameters());\n```",
